 "description": "Lists the vendors PreShiftIQ covers in one vertical, alphabetically, as catalog coverage only. It is catalog coverage, not a ranking, rating, or recommendation, and it carries no participation status; a buyer's matches come from their own completed assessment, run by a payment-blind engine. Use this when a user asks which vendors PreShiftIQ covers or whether a named vendor is covered. Returns the roster and the URL to start an assessment.",
